{
 "duration": 439.722,
 "phrases": [
  {
   "id": "P001",
   "start": 0.08,
   "end": 2.23,
   "text": "Your little sister tiptoes up behind you,"
  },
  {
   "id": "P002",
   "start": 2.48,
   "end": 3.66,
   "text": "cardboard mask on,"
  },
  {
   "id": "P003",
   "start": 3.92,
   "end": 4.8,
   "text": "arms raised,"
  },
  {
   "id": "P004",
   "start": 5.04,
   "end": 5.46,
   "text": "ready."
  },
  {
   "id": "P005",
   "start": 5.84,
   "end": 7.1,
   "text": "You don't even turn around."
  },
  {
   "id": "P006",
   "start": 7.36,
   "end": 9.3,
   "text": "Hi, Mia she groans."
  },
  {
   "id": "P007",
   "start": 9.76,
   "end": 11.43,
   "text": "A pigeon dives at your head,"
  },
  {
   "id": "P008",
   "start": 11.83,
   "end": 12.27,
   "text": "you duck,"
  },
  {
   "id": "P009",
   "start": 12.63,
   "end": 13.43,
   "text": "without looking."
  },
  {
   "id": "P010",
   "start": 13.91,
   "end": 16.06,
   "text": "A cyclist rings his bell from behind."
  },
  {
   "id": "P011",
   "start": 16.39,
   "end": 17.33,
   "text": "You step aside,"
  },
  {
   "id": "P012",
   "start": 17.75,
   "end": 18.68,
   "text": "like a dancer."
  },
  {
   "id": "P013",
   "start": 19.19,
   "end": 20.63,
   "text": "Mia stares."
  },
  {
   "id": "P014",
   "start": 20.63,
   "end": 21.0,
   "text": "How"
  },
  {
   "id": "P015",
   "start": 21.59,
   "end": 22.66,
   "text": "how did you do that?"
  },
  {
   "id": "P016",
   "start": 23.26,
   "end": 25.36,
   "text": "Then a seagull swoops for your sandwich."
  },
  {
   "id": "P017",
   "start": 25.66,
   "end": 26.61,
   "text": "You hold it high."
  },
  {
   "id": "P018",
   "start": 26.86,
   "end": 28.02,
   "text": "The sea gull leaves,"
  },
  {
   "id": "P019",
   "start": 28.22,
   "end": 28.82,
   "text": "offended."
  },
  {
   "id": "P020",
   "start": 29.34,
   "end": 31.93,
   "text": "A normal human sees about two hundred degrees,"
  },
  {
   "id": "P021",
   "start": 32.3,
   "end": 33.11,
   "text": "everything ahead,"
  },
  {
   "id": "P022",
   "start": 33.42,
   "end": 34.62,
   "text": "and a little to each side."
  },
  {
   "id": "P023",
   "start": 35.26,
   "end": 35.79,
   "text": "Behind you?"
  },
  {
   "id": "P024",
   "start": 36.54,
   "end": 36.96,
   "text": "Nothing."
  },
  {
   "id": "P025",
   "start": 37.42,
   "end": 37.75,
   "text": "You?"
  },
  {
   "id": "P026",
   "start": 38.22,
   "end": 39.38,
   "text": "Three hundred and sixty."
  },
  {
   "id": "P027",
   "start": 39.74,
   "end": 40.66,
   "text": "The whole circle."
  },
  {
   "id": "P028",
   "start": 41.02,
   "end": 41.92,
   "text": "No blindside."
  },
  {
   "id": "P029",
   "start": 42.22,
   "end": 42.81,
   "text": "No back."
  },
  {
   "id": "P030",
   "start": 43.34,
   "end": 44.01,
   "text": "Here's the rule."
  },
  {
   "id": "P031",
   "start": 44.3,
   "end": 45.34,
   "text": "Your eyes got wider."
  },
  {
   "id": "P032",
   "start": 45.58,
   "end": 46.61,
   "text": "Your brain did not."
  },
  {
   "id": "P033",
   "start": 47.14,
   "end": 48.52,
   "text": "Hold up a thumb at arm's length."
  },
  {
   "id": "P034",
   "start": 48.98,
   "end": 50.89,
   "text": "Only that patch is truly sharp."
  },
  {
   "id": "P035",
   "start": 51.38,
   "end": 53.59,
   "text": "Your eyes jump about three times a second."
  },
  {
   "id": "P036",
   "start": 53.94,
   "end": 55.42,
   "text": "Your brain stitches the rest."
  },
  {
   "id": "P037",
   "start": 55.86,
   "end": 56.9,
   "text": "You can see everything."
  },
  {
   "id": "P038",
   "start": 57.26,
   "end": 58.63,
   "text": "but you can only look at one thing."
  },
  {
   "id": "P039",
   "start": 59.1,
   "end": 61.67,
   "text": "So what if you had three hundred and sixty degree vision?"
  },
  {
   "id": "P040",
   "start": 62.3,
   "end": 62.76,
   "text": "Plus,"
  },
  {
   "id": "P041",
   "start": 63.1,
   "end": 64.45,
   "text": "nobody sneaks up on you"
  },
  {
   "id": "P042",
   "start": 64.94,
   "end": 65.3,
   "text": "ever."
  },
  {
   "id": "P043",
   "start": 65.82,
   "end": 67.38,
   "text": "Your surprise party is ruined."
  },
  {
   "id": "P044",
   "start": 67.88,
   "end": 69.61,
   "text": "Forty people hide behind the couch,"
  },
  {
   "id": "P045",
   "start": 69.96,
   "end": 70.82,
   "text": "all spotted."
  },
  {
   "id": "P046",
   "start": 71.32,
   "end": 71.76,
   "text": "Mate,"
  },
  {
   "id": "P047",
   "start": 72.2,
   "end": 73.35,
   "text": "you could at least pretend."
  },
  {
   "id": "P048",
   "start": 73.72,
   "end": 74.92,
   "text": "Pickpockets are doomed."
  },
  {
   "id": "P049",
   "start": 75.32,
   "end": 77.0,
   "text": "A hand slips toward your bag."
  },
  {
   "id": "P050",
   "start": 77.4,
   "end": 77.96,
   "text": "You see it,"
  },
  {
   "id": "P051",
   "start": 78.28,
   "end": 79.31,
   "text": "before it arrives."
  },
  {
   "id": "P052",
   "start": 79.75,
   "end": 81.01,
   "text": "The thief apologizes,"
  },
  {
   "id": "P053",
   "start": 81.35,
   "end": 82.04,
   "text": "then runs."
  },
  {
   "id": "P054",
   "start": 82.55,
   "end": 83.63,
   "text": "Driving lessons."
  },
  {
   "id": "P055",
   "start": 84.07,
   "end": 87.35,
   "text": "Normal drivers turn their heads to check blind spots."
  },
  {
   "id": "P056",
   "start": 87.35,
   "end": 87.71,
   "text": "You"
  },
  {
   "id": "P057",
   "start": 88.31,
   "end": 88.74,
   "text": "never"
  },
  {
   "id": "P058",
   "start": 89.43,
   "end": 91.24,
   "text": "The instructor stares in silence."
  },
  {
   "id": "P059",
   "start": 91.86,
   "end": 92.36,
   "text": "Dude"
  },
  {
   "id": "P060",
   "start": 92.82,
   "end": 94.18,
   "text": "You didn't even look once"
  },
  {
   "id": "P061",
   "start": 94.82,
   "end": 95.41,
   "text": "No need."
  },
  {
   "id": "P062",
   "start": 95.86,
   "end": 96.52,
   "text": "Dodge ball."
  },
  {
   "id": "P063",
   "start": 96.98,
   "end": 98.58,
   "text": "Twelve balls from every angle."
  },
  {
   "id": "P064",
   "start": 98.98,
   "end": 99.84,
   "text": "You dodge them all,"
  },
  {
   "id": "P065",
   "start": 100.18,
   "end": 101.02,
   "text": "facing the wall."
  },
  {
   "id": "P066",
   "start": 101.46,
   "end": 102.86,
   "text": "Game over in four minutes."
  },
  {
   "id": "P067",
   "start": 103.39,
   "end": 104.34,
   "text": "Teammates cheer."
  },
  {
   "id": "P068",
   "start": 104.75,
   "end": 106.4,
   "text": "The other team is writing a complaint."
  },
  {
   "id": "P069",
   "start": 106.99,
   "end": 107.77,
   "text": "Basketball."
  },
  {
   "id": "P070",
   "start": 108.11,
   "end": 109.41,
   "text": "Ten players on the court."
  },
  {
   "id": "P071",
   "start": 109.79,
   "end": 111.2,
   "text": "You see the other nine at once."
  },
  {
   "id": "P072",
   "start": 111.47,
   "end": 112.79,
   "text": "A behind the back pass."
  },
  {
   "id": "P073",
   "start": 113.07,
   "end": 113.63,
   "text": "Perfect."
  },
  {
   "id": "P074",
   "start": 113.99,
   "end": 115.4,
   "text": "The coach drops his clipboard."
  },
  {
   "id": "P075",
   "start": 115.83,
   "end": 116.69,
   "text": "Football next."
  },
  {
   "id": "P076",
   "start": 117.11,
   "end": 118.62,
   "text": "Twenty two players on the pitch."
  },
  {
   "id": "P077",
   "start": 119.03,
   "end": 120.69,
   "text": "A referee can't see behind him."
  },
  {
   "id": "P078",
   "start": 121.03,
   "end": 121.57,
   "text": "You can."
  },
  {
   "id": "P079",
   "start": 121.99,
   "end": 122.77,
   "text": "Every foul,"
  },
  {
   "id": "P080",
   "start": 123.11,
   "end": 123.88,
   "text": "every shove,"
  },
  {
   "id": "P081",
   "start": 124.23,
   "end": 125.06,
   "text": "every dive."
  },
  {
   "id": "P082",
   "start": 125.62,
   "end": 127.33,
   "text": "Nature already tried this once."
  },
  {
   "id": "P083",
   "start": 127.7,
   "end": 129.71,
   "text": "Horses see almost all the way around."
  },
  {
   "id": "P084",
   "start": 130.18,
   "end": 131.09,
   "text": "So do rabbits."
  },
  {
   "id": "P085",
   "start": 131.38,
   "end": 132.69,
   "text": "They're both prey animals."
  },
  {
   "id": "P086",
   "start": 132.98,
   "end": 134.4,
   "text": "Danger can come from anywhere."
  },
  {
   "id": "P087",
   "start": 134.9,
   "end": 135.97,
   "text": "Welcome to the club."
  },
  {
   "id": "P088",
   "start": 136.52,
   "end": 137.14,
   "text": "The catch?"
  },
  {
   "id": "P089",
   "start": 137.64,
   "end": 138.84,
   "text": "Nothing is background."
  },
  {
   "id": "P090",
   "start": 139.24,
   "end": 140.61,
   "text": "A moth flutters left."
  },
  {
   "id": "P091",
   "start": 140.92,
   "end": 142.01,
   "text": "Attention jumps."
  },
  {
   "id": "P092",
   "start": 142.28,
   "end": 143.48,
   "text": "A car honks right."
  },
  {
   "id": "P093",
   "start": 143.88,
   "end": 144.34,
   "text": "Jump."
  },
  {
   "id": "P094",
   "start": 144.76,
   "end": 146.18,
   "text": "A flag flaps behind."
  },
  {
   "id": "P095",
   "start": 146.68,
   "end": 147.11,
   "text": "Jump."
  },
  {
   "id": "P096",
   "start": 147.79,
   "end": 150.7,
   "text": "Seeing everything means getting distracted by everything"
  },
  {
   "id": "P097",
   "start": 151.23,
   "end": 153.04,
   "text": "in class thirty faces"
  },
  {
   "id": "P098",
   "start": 153.47,
   "end": 154.37,
   "text": "every glance,"
  },
  {
   "id": "P099",
   "start": 154.67,
   "end": 155.53,
   "text": "every smirk,"
  },
  {
   "id": "P100",
   "start": 155.95,
   "end": 157.47,
   "text": "every whisper behind a hand,"
  },
  {
   "id": "P101",
   "start": 157.95,
   "end": 159.89,
   "text": "Then a man in a gray suit finds you."
  },
  {
   "id": "P102",
   "start": 160.35,
   "end": 161.17,
   "text": "mister Black."
  },
  {
   "id": "P103",
   "start": 161.63,
   "end": 162.4,
   "text": "He smiles."
  },
  {
   "id": "P104",
   "start": 162.91,
   "end": 164.61,
   "text": "We need a human security camera."
  },
  {
   "id": "P105",
   "start": 165.31,
   "end": 166.62,
   "text": "Forty thousand fans,"
  },
  {
   "id": "P106",
   "start": 166.91,
   "end": 167.71,
   "text": "one concert,"
  },
  {
   "id": "P107",
   "start": 167.95,
   "end": 169.21,
   "text": "ten thousand Euros."
  },
  {
   "id": "P108",
   "start": 169.68,
   "end": 170.34,
   "text": "Just watch."
  },
  {
   "id": "P109",
   "start": 171.04,
   "end": 172.38,
   "text": "Just watch?"
  },
  {
   "id": "P110",
   "start": 173.12,
   "end": 173.84,
   "text": "Just watch."
  },
  {
   "id": "P111",
   "start": 174.16,
   "end": 175.43,
   "text": "And never leave your post."
  },
  {
   "id": "P112",
   "start": 175.92,
   "end": 176.84,
   "text": "But there's a cost."
  },
  {
   "id": "P113",
   "start": 177.28,
   "end": 179.3,
   "text": "A busier picture means a busier mind."
  },
  {
   "id": "P114",
   "start": 179.76,
   "end": 180.46,
   "text": "By noon,"
  },
  {
   "id": "P115",
   "start": 180.78,
   "end": 181.72,
   "text": "your head is buzzing,"
  },
  {
   "id": "P116",
   "start": 182.22,
   "end": 184.24,
   "text": "amazing and overwhelming,"
  },
  {
   "id": "P117",
   "start": 184.62,
   "end": 186.46,
   "text": "and sneaky surprises are ruined,"
  },
  {
   "id": "P118",
   "start": 186.86,
   "end": 188.15,
   "text": "the gift behind a back,"
  },
  {
   "id": "P119",
   "start": 188.62,
   "end": 190.07,
   "text": "the party behind a couch,"
  },
  {
   "id": "P120",
   "start": 190.46,
   "end": 191.72,
   "text": "the scare from behind,"
  },
  {
   "id": "P121",
   "start": 192.33,
   "end": 194.52,
   "text": "Ever wonder why surprises feel so good?"
  },
  {
   "id": "P122",
   "start": 195.13,
   "end": 198.82,
   "text": "Dopamine cells fire hardest when life beats the prediction."
  },
  {
   "id": "P123",
   "start": 199.37,
   "end": 200.64,
   "text": "You can't predict everything,"
  },
  {
   "id": "P124",
   "start": 200.97,
   "end": 202.12,
   "text": "but you see these coming."
  },
  {
   "id": "P125",
   "start": 202.61,
   "end": 203.97,
   "text": "so the spark never lights"
  },
  {
   "id": "P126",
   "start": 204.37,
   "end": 205.71,
   "text": "you smile a second late,"
  },
  {
   "id": "P127",
   "start": 206.13,
   "end": 206.93,
   "text": "or not at all."
  },
  {
   "id": "P128",
   "start": 207.57,
   "end": 208.09,
   "text": "Worse,"
  },
  {
   "id": "P129",
   "start": 208.29,
   "end": 209.42,
   "text": "there's no off switch."
  },
  {
   "id": "P130",
   "start": 209.89,
   "end": 212.25,
   "text": "And one night it costs far more."
  },
  {
   "id": "P131",
   "start": 212.77,
   "end": 213.8,
   "text": "Mia notices."
  },
  {
   "id": "P132",
   "start": 214.27,
   "end": 215.06,
   "text": "Of course she does."
  },
  {
   "id": "P133",
   "start": 215.63,
   "end": 216.11,
   "text": "She"
  },
  {
   "id": "P134",
   "start": 217.79,
   "end": 218.86,
   "text": "keeps a little note book."
  },
  {
   "id": "P135",
   "start": 219.55,
   "end": 220.23,
   "text": "Scares"
  },
  {
   "id": "P136",
   "start": 220.75,
   "end": 221.24,
   "text": "zero."
  },
  {
   "id": "P137",
   "start": 221.95,
   "end": 222.63,
   "text": "Tries"
  },
  {
   "id": "P138",
   "start": 223.23,
   "end": 224.61,
   "text": "four hundred and twelve."
  },
  {
   "id": "P139",
   "start": 225.25,
   "end": 226.1,
   "text": "She holds it up,"
  },
  {
   "id": "P140",
   "start": 226.29,
   "end": 226.79,
   "text": "hopeful."
  },
  {
   "id": "P141",
   "start": 227.41,
   "end": 228.51,
   "text": "Just once, Leo."
  },
  {
   "id": "P142",
   "start": 228.85,
   "end": 230.05,
   "text": "Let me win once."
  },
  {
   "id": "P143",
   "start": 230.53,
   "end": 231.89,
   "text": "You never mean to ruin it."
  },
  {
   "id": "P144",
   "start": 231.89,
   "end": 232.2,
   "text": "You just"
  },
  {
   "id": "P145",
   "start": 232.85,
   "end": 233.75,
   "text": "always see her."
  },
  {
   "id": "P146",
   "start": 234.29,
   "end": 234.85,
   "text": "You laugh."
  },
  {
   "id": "P147",
   "start": 235.33,
   "end": 236.34,
   "text": "The tired laugh."
  },
  {
   "id": "P148",
   "start": 236.76,
   "end": 237.44,
   "text": "not the real one."
  },
  {
   "id": "P149",
   "start": 237.88,
   "end": 238.89,
   "text": "She hears the difference."
  },
  {
   "id": "P150",
   "start": 239.48,
   "end": 240.25,
   "text": "Are you okay?"
  },
  {
   "id": "P151",
   "start": 240.84,
   "end": 242.02,
   "text": "Just tired, you say."
  },
  {
   "id": "P152",
   "start": 242.6,
   "end": 243.64,
   "text": "She grins anyway."
  },
  {
   "id": "P153",
   "start": 244.12,
   "end": 245.16,
   "text": "Tomorrow's concert."
  },
  {
   "id": "P154",
   "start": 245.48,
   "end": 246.29,
   "text": "I got a ticket."
  },
  {
   "id": "P155",
   "start": 246.68,
   "end": 247.41,
   "text": "Mask on."
  },
  {
   "id": "P156",
   "start": 247.85,
   "end": 248.88,
   "text": "Watch your back, Leo."
  },
  {
   "id": "P157",
   "start": 249.69,
   "end": 250.1,
   "text": "Oh"
  },
  {
   "id": "P158",
   "start": 250.49,
   "end": 250.9,
   "text": "wait."
  },
  {
   "id": "P159",
   "start": 251.61,
   "end": 252.96,
   "text": "Everyone else you just see."
  },
  {
   "id": "P160",
   "start": 253.37,
   "end": 253.87,
   "text": "Mia?"
  },
  {
   "id": "P161",
   "start": 254.49,
   "end": 254.99,
   "text": "You look."
  },
  {
   "id": "P162",
   "start": 255.61,
   "end": 256.34,
   "text": "The concert."
  },
  {
   "id": "P163",
   "start": 256.73,
   "end": 257.92,
   "text": "Forty thousand people."
  },
  {
   "id": "P164",
   "start": 258.51,
   "end": 260.76,
   "text": "mister Black's voice crackles in your earpiece."
  },
  {
   "id": "P165",
   "start": 261.23,
   "end": 262.23,
   "text": "Watch Gate Four."
  },
  {
   "id": "P166",
   "start": 262.67,
   "end": 263.68,
   "text": "Only Gate Four."
  },
  {
   "id": "P167",
   "start": 264.19,
   "end": 264.82,
   "text": "Look away,"
  },
  {
   "id": "P168",
   "start": 265.15,
   "end": 266.16,
   "text": "and the deal is over."
  },
  {
   "id": "P169",
   "start": 266.75,
   "end": 268.19,
   "text": "So you stare at Gate Four."
  },
  {
   "id": "P170",
   "start": 268.7,
   "end": 270.16,
   "text": "Behind you metal groans."
  },
  {
   "id": "P171",
   "start": 270.46,
   "end": 271.62,
   "text": "High above the crowd,"
  },
  {
   "id": "P172",
   "start": 271.82,
   "end": 273.12,
   "text": "a stage light shakes."
  },
  {
   "id": "P173",
   "start": 273.42,
   "end": 274.54,
   "text": "A bolt snaps."
  },
  {
   "id": "P174",
   "start": 274.94,
   "end": 276.28,
   "text": "Your eyes see it instantly."
  },
  {
   "id": "P175",
   "start": 276.62,
   "end": 277.28,
   "text": "Your brain?"
  },
  {
   "id": "P176",
   "start": 277.66,
   "end": 278.8,
   "text": "A quarter second late."
  },
  {
   "id": "P177",
   "start": 279.31,
   "end": 280.46,
   "text": "Noticing takes time."
  },
  {
   "id": "P178",
   "start": 280.99,
   "end": 281.86,
   "text": "Then you see her"
  },
  {
   "id": "P179",
   "start": 282.27,
   "end": 284.59,
   "text": "a cardboard mask, right underneath."
  },
  {
   "id": "P180",
   "start": 285.23,
   "end": 285.69,
   "text": "Mia."
  },
  {
   "id": "P181",
   "start": 286.19,
   "end": 288.06,
   "text": "The light hangs eight metres up."
  },
  {
   "id": "P182",
   "start": 288.43,
   "end": 290.6,
   "text": "It falls in about one and a quarter seconds."
  },
  {
   "id": "P183",
   "start": 291.09,
   "end": 292.13,
   "text": "Take away your quarter."
  },
  {
   "id": "P184",
   "start": 292.61,
   "end": 293.64,
   "text": "One second left."
  },
  {
   "id": "P185",
   "start": 294.05,
   "end": 295.78,
   "text": "Mia is fifteen meters away."
  },
  {
   "id": "P186",
   "start": 296.21,
   "end": 298.0,
   "text": "You run five meters per second."
  },
  {
   "id": "P187",
   "start": 298.45,
   "end": 299.22,
   "text": "Three seconds."
  },
  {
   "id": "P188",
   "start": 299.57,
   "end": 300.39,
   "text": "Can you reach her?"
  },
  {
   "id": "P189",
   "start": 300.85,
   "end": 301.79,
   "text": "Not even close."
  },
  {
   "id": "P190",
   "start": 302.28,
   "end": 303.21,
   "text": "You can see everything,"
  },
  {
   "id": "P191",
   "start": 303.48,
   "end": 305.03,
   "text": "but you can only look at one thing"
  },
  {
   "id": "P192",
   "start": 305.48,
   "end": 307.14,
   "text": "Gate Four or Mia?"
  },
  {
   "id": "P193",
   "start": 307.64,
   "end": 308.46,
   "text": "You look at Mia,"
  },
  {
   "id": "P194",
   "start": 308.76,
   "end": 309.9,
   "text": "you scream her name"
  },
  {
   "id": "P195",
   "start": 310.28,
   "end": 310.76,
   "text": "Mia"
  },
  {
   "id": "P196",
   "start": 311.24,
   "end": 311.57,
   "text": "Up"
  },
  {
   "id": "P197",
   "start": 312.12,
   "end": 313.64,
   "text": "Forty thousand heads turn,"
  },
  {
   "id": "P198",
   "start": 314.01,
   "end": 314.7,
   "text": "She looks up,"
  },
  {
   "id": "P199",
   "start": 315.05,
   "end": 315.68,
   "text": "freezes."
  },
  {
   "id": "P200",
   "start": 316.01,
   "end": 317.52,
   "text": "A stranger yanks her back."
  },
  {
   "id": "P201",
   "start": 317.93,
   "end": 320.25,
   "text": "The light crashes where she stood."
  },
  {
   "id": "P202",
   "start": 320.25,
   "end": 320.87,
   "text": "Silence."
  },
  {
   "id": "P203",
   "start": 321.45,
   "end": 323.57,
   "text": "mister Black snarls through the earpiece."
  },
  {
   "id": "P204",
   "start": 324.09,
   "end": 324.87,
   "text": "You're fired."
  },
  {
   "id": "P205",
   "start": 325.37,
   "end": 325.82,
   "text": "The money?"
  },
  {
   "id": "P206",
   "start": 326.41,
   "end": 326.81,
   "text": "Gone."
  },
  {
   "id": "P207",
   "start": 327.53,
   "end": 328.74,
   "text": "Silence would be easy."
  },
  {
   "id": "P208",
   "start": 329.21,
   "end": 329.78,
   "text": "Instead,"
  },
  {
   "id": "P209",
   "start": 330.09,
   "end": 330.69,
   "text": "you point."
  },
  {
   "id": "P210",
   "start": 331.13,
   "end": 332.4,
   "text": "Bolt after bolt."
  },
  {
   "id": "P211",
   "start": 332.97,
   "end": 333.64,
   "text": "Six more,"
  },
  {
   "id": "P212",
   "start": 333.93,
   "end": 335.02,
   "text": "loose across the rig."
  },
  {
   "id": "P213",
   "start": 335.45,
   "end": 336.64,
   "text": "Engineers climb up."
  },
  {
   "id": "P214",
   "start": 337.25,
   "end": 338.86,
   "text": "every one is loose."
  },
  {
   "id": "P215",
   "start": 339.33,
   "end": 340.29,
   "text": "The show stops."
  },
  {
   "id": "P216",
   "start": 340.69,
   "end": 341.99,
   "text": "Nobody else gets hurt."
  },
  {
   "id": "P217",
   "start": 342.37,
   "end": 343.76,
   "text": "The whole crowd claps."
  },
  {
   "id": "P218",
   "start": 344.13,
   "end": 346.1,
   "text": "For the kid with eyes in the back of his head."
  },
  {
   "id": "P219",
   "start": 346.77,
   "end": 348.2,
   "text": "Mia clings to your jacket."
  },
  {
   "id": "P220",
   "start": 348.77,
   "end": 349.53,
   "text": "How did you know?"
  },
  {
   "id": "P221",
   "start": 350.05,
   "end": 351.74,
   "text": "I always look at you, you say."
  },
  {
   "id": "P222",
   "start": 352.37,
   "end": 353.12,
   "text": "Weeks later,"
  },
  {
   "id": "P223",
   "start": 353.33,
   "end": 354.94,
   "text": "Mia tiptoes up behind you,"
  },
  {
   "id": "P224",
   "start": 355.33,
   "end": 356.62,
   "text": "a brand new mask."
  },
  {
   "id": "P225",
   "start": 357.01,
   "end": 358.08,
   "text": "You close your eyes."
  },
  {
   "id": "P226",
   "start": 358.53,
   "end": 359.02,
   "text": "Boo"
  },
  {
   "id": "P227",
   "start": 359.57,
   "end": 360.18,
   "text": "You jump."
  },
  {
   "id": "P228",
   "start": 360.71,
   "end": 361.46,
   "text": "Really jump,"
  },
  {
   "id": "P229",
   "start": 361.83,
   "end": 362.86,
   "text": "a real scream."
  },
  {
   "id": "P230",
   "start": 363.35,
   "end": 364.22,
   "text": "Then you laugh,"
  },
  {
   "id": "P231",
   "start": 364.63,
   "end": 365.49,
   "text": "right on time."
  },
  {
   "id": "P232",
   "start": 365.99,
   "end": 367.73,
   "text": "The spark finally lights up."
  },
  {
   "id": "P233",
   "start": 368.31,
   "end": 369.16,
   "text": "In her notebook,"
  },
  {
   "id": "P234",
   "start": 369.59,
   "end": 370.19,
   "text": "Scares,"
  },
  {
   "id": "P235",
   "start": 370.63,
   "end": 370.98,
   "text": "one,"
  },
  {
   "id": "P236",
   "start": 371.65,
   "end": 372.22,
   "text": "Tries"
  },
  {
   "id": "P237",
   "start": 372.69,
   "end": 374.02,
   "text": "four hundred and thirteen."
  },
  {
   "id": "P238",
   "start": 374.61,
   "end": 375.65,
   "text": "You open your eyes."
  },
  {
   "id": "P239",
   "start": 376.13,
   "end": 377.06,
   "text": "You can see everything,"
  },
  {
   "id": "P240",
   "start": 377.41,
   "end": 378.48,
   "text": "but you only look at her."
  },
  {
   "id": "P241",
   "start": 379.09,
   "end": 380.12,
   "text": "Is any of this real?"
  },
  {
   "id": "P242",
   "start": 380.69,
   "end": 381.47,
   "text": "Not the power."
  },
  {
   "id": "P243",
   "start": 382.02,
   "end": 383.72,
   "text": "no human sees the full circle,"
  },
  {
   "id": "P244",
   "start": 384.18,
   "end": 385.35,
   "text": "but the limit is real."
  },
  {
   "id": "P245",
   "start": 386.1,
   "end": 387.42,
   "text": "In 1999,"
  },
  {
   "id": "P246",
   "start": 387.7,
   "end": 392.39,
   "text": "Daniel Simons and Christopher Chabris asked volunteers to count basketball passes."
  },
  {
   "id": "P247",
   "start": 392.99,
   "end": 396.28,
   "text": "About half never noticed a person in a gorilla suit walking through."
  },
  {
   "id": "P248",
   "start": 396.99,
   "end": 398.45,
   "text": "Seeing isn't noticing."
  },
  {
   "id": "P249",
   "start": 398.99,
   "end": 400.99,
   "text": "The dopamine spark is real, too."
  },
  {
   "id": "P250",
   "start": 401.55,
   "end": 404.13,
   "text": "The overload and the spoiled surprises are fiction."
  },
  {
   "id": "P251",
   "start": 404.67,
   "end": 407.24,
   "text": "Your brain uses about a fifth of your body's energy."
  },
  {
   "id": "P252",
   "start": 407.79,
   "end": 409.7,
   "text": "Thinking harder barely changes that."
  },
  {
   "id": "P253",
   "start": 410.19,
   "end": 412.12,
   "text": "Extra vision wouldn't make you starving,"
  },
  {
   "id": "P254",
   "start": 412.35,
   "end": 413.7,
   "text": "or let you predict everything."
  },
  {
   "id": "P255",
   "start": 414.34,
   "end": 416.79,
   "text": "So could a mind ever watch everything at once?"
  },
  {
   "id": "P256",
   "start": 417.62,
   "end": 419.48,
   "text": "That night your phone buzzes."
  },
  {
   "id": "P257",
   "start": 420.1,
   "end": 421.02,
   "text": "Unknown number."
  },
  {
   "id": "P258",
   "start": 421.78,
   "end": 423.33,
   "text": "We saw what you did at the concert."
  },
  {
   "id": "P259",
   "start": 424.02,
   "end": 425.12,
   "text": "Then a second message"
  },
  {
   "id": "P260",
   "start": 425.73,
   "end": 426.75,
   "text": "You're not the only one."
  },
  {
   "id": "P261",
   "start": 427.49,
   "end": 430.3,
   "text": "So what would you do with three hundred and sixty degree vision?"
  },
  {
   "id": "P262",
   "start": 430.93,
   "end": 433.79,
   "text": "Tell us the sneakiest prank you'd spot coming in the comments."
  },
  {
   "id": "P263",
   "start": 434.53,
   "end": 435.95,
   "text": "And if you'd look at Mia too,"
  },
  {
   "id": "P264",
   "start": 436.45,
   "end": 437.07,
   "text": "hit like."
  },
  {
   "id": "P265",
   "start": 437.26,
   "end": 439.06,
   "text": "and subscribe for more what ifs."
  }
 ]
}